file: "packages/editor/src/state/undo_log.ts"
doc: "An undo entry learns to carry the pendingEdits list its redo should restore."

structs: [
  { name: "UndoEntry"
    change_type: MODIFIED
    doc:
      "One optional field added: `pendingEditsAfter`. The other four are\n"
      "unchanged.\n"
      "\n"
      "WHY. Redo re-applies an entry by folding entry.edit over the current\n"
      "stylesheet, and applyStyleEditToStylesheet copies pendingEdits through\n"
      "untouched -- a StyleEdit describes element changes and cannot describe\n"
      "a change to the proposal list. So redoing an accept would re-apply the\n"
      "element changes and leave the proposal still listed and still drawn by\n"
      "the ghost layer: the applied-and-still-pending state acceptPending\n"
      "exists to avoid. Redoing a reject, or a comment, would do nothing at\n"
      "all.\n"
      "\n"
      "WHEN SET, redo writes this array as the stylesheet's pendingEdits\n"
      "after folding entry.edit, instead of carrying the current one through.\n"
      "The three review writes on EditorState set it; ordinary applyStyleEdit\n"
      "does not, and when it is absent redo behaves exactly as before.\n"
      "\n"
      "It is the symmetric partner of BeforeSnapshot.pendingEditsBefore,\n"
      "which undo already restores the same way -- and it inherits that\n"
      "field's one flaw, deliberately. Both hold the WHOLE array rather than\n"
      "a delta, so a write that changes pendingEdits without touching either\n"
      "log makes a stored copy stale, and a later redo reverts it. The\n"
      "writes that can do that are appendPendingEdit and adoptStylesheet via\n"
      "the external-file sync. The cost is accepted here rather than fixed:\n"
      "a targeted delta is the right shape, but changing pendingEditsBefore\n"
      "to match is a rewrite of the undo model and is not this pillar."
    fields: [
      { name: "beforeSnapshot",    type: { named: { symbol: "BeforeSnapshot" } } },
      { name: "edit",              type: { named: { symbol: "archeglyph.style.v1.StyleEdit" } } },
      { name: "tsMs",              type: { primitive: REAL } },
      { name: "coalesceKey",       type: { primitive: CHARACTER }, is_optional: true },
      { name: "pendingEditsAfter", type: { named: { symbol: "Array", args: [{ named: { symbol: "archeglyph.style.v1.StyleEdit" } }] } }, is_optional: true }
    ]
    typescript: { struct_kind: STRUCT_KIND_INTERFACE }
  }
]
